    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d306-a1">

                <pb facs="0401" n="303" sameAs="frus:frus1920v01/pg303"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Draft Protocol of Agreement between the Dominican
                        Republic and the Republic of Haiti</hi></head>
                <p>[This enclosure is identical with the final draft, printed on <ref
                        target="#pg308">page 308</ref>, with the following exceptions:</p>
                <pb facs="0402" n="304" xml:id="pg304"/>
                <p>Article 2 in the present enclosure lacks the second paragraph of article 2 in the
                    final draft.</p>
                <p>Article 9 in the present enclosure, replaced by articles 9 and 10 in the final
                    draft, reads as follows (file translation revised):</p>
                <p>The power conferred upon the Holy Father will also embrace a decision upon the
                    following points: <list>
                        <label>(<hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>)</label>
                        <item>By whom shall the expenses entailed by the survey of the boundary line
                            be defrayed?</item>
                        <label><hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>)</label>
                        <item>How shall that survey be made?</item>
                        <label>(<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>)</label>
                        <item>Who shall make it?</item>
                    </list></p>
                <p>The final article of the present draft, article 10, is identical with article 11
                    of the final draft.]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
